---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
const updated = '20 October 2026';
---

<Base title="Privacy at Comarket" description="What Comarket collects on this site, why, and how to have it deleted." stage="none">
  <header class="top wrap">
    <a class="wm" href="/?fork=1">Comarket</a>
  </header>
  <main class="wrap doc">
    <span class="label">Updated {updated}</span>
    <h1 class="display-l">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="lede">This site runs a waitlist. Here is everything it collects and why.</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><b>When you join the waitlist:</b> your email, and either your website (brands) or your handle and platform (creators).</li>
      <li><b>If you allow it:</b> a random visitor ID in a cookie, which version of a page you saw, and simple events like which side you chose. We use this to learn which pages work.</li>
      <li><b>Always:</b> your country, as reported by our hosting provider, so we know whether to ask before setting cookies.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What we don’t do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We don’t sell your data or share it with advertisers.</li>
      <li>We don’t use third-party ad trackers on this site.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Who processes it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Cloudflare hosts the site and runs our servers.</li>
      <li>Neon stores the waitlist in a Postgres database.</li>
      <li>Resend sends the one confirmation email.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>
      Decline cookies and nothing about your visit is stored. To see or delete your waitlist entry, email us from the address you
      signed up with and we’ll do it.
    </p>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>

<style>
  .top {
    padding-block: calc(22px + env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px)) 0;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .wm {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 21px;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .doc {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    max-width: 820px;
    padding-block: clamp(64px, 10vw, 140px);
    display: grid;
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .doc h1 {
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
  .doc h2 {
    margin-top: 28px;
    font-size: 24px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .doc ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 20px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    max-width: 62ch;
  }
  .doc p {
    max-width: 62ch;
  }
</style>
